                <pb facs="1279" n="1155" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg1155"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 401.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p>In view of the annually-increasing emigration of Swiss citizens, the Federal
                    Council is hereby requested to examine this question, and to present a report as
                    speedily as possible to the Federal Assembly, together with suggestions in
                    regard to the manner in which aimless emigration may be prevented, and the
                    efforts, especially of families seeking new homes, may be properly directed.</p>
            </div>
